#, no-wrap
msgid "Warmaster Revolution"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/home/modules/ROOT/pages/index.adoc:12
msgid ""
"_Warmaster Revolution_ is a fan-based second edition of rules for the "
"Warmaster game. Official rules are published in PDF format on the community "
"website, https://www.wm-revolution.com/[wm-revolution.com]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/home/modules/ROOT/pages/index.adoc:14
msgid ""
"This website contains the _Warmaster Revolution_ xref:revolution:rules:index."
"adoc[rules] (version {compendium-version}) and xref:revolution:armies:index."
"adoc[army lists] (version {armies-version}) for easier electronic browsing "
"and searching.  Some text has been reorganised or slightly reworded, based "
"on similar changes in later editions of _Warmaster_, but _there are no "
"changes to the rules of the game_.  These edits are marked with dotted "
"underlines or coloured borders, see xref:revolution:rules:editors-note."
"adoc#website-editors-note[this explanation] for details.  Many minor "
"spelling and grammar improvements are not marked."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/home/modules/ROOT/pages/index.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Note the search box at the top of the page returns pages with _any one_ of "
"the search words.  To force the results to contain a specific word, prefix "
"it with a `+` as in `+Dark +Elves`."
msgstr ""

